# CLIP EDITING in the EDIT LIST (TRACKS, EDIT; white 1-14; each one undo step): white 1 = QUANTIZE (every note toward the 1/16 by the
# track's QUANT), 2 = COPY BAR, 3 = PASTE BAR (stopped: into the bar after the copied one, the next press the one after that).
# The old SEQ + black and HOME + black 7-11 combos are gone.
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
page 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
expect track 0
expect part 0
expect nev 0
listen
qnt 50
setbars 0 4
seedat 0 1 30
seedat 0 1 400
expect events 2
page 11
tap LFO
wait 100
expect layview 1
shot p37_edit_list.png
# QUANTIZE at 50%: 30 -> 27, 400 -> 404
tapkey w0
wait 100
said ON THE GRID
expect evpos 27
shot p38_clip_quant.png
expect evlast 404
# one undo step brings the notes back
press LFO
wait 800
release LFO
wait 100
expect evpos 30
expect evlast 400
# QUANTIZE with QUANT 0 says so and moves nothing
qnt 0
tapkey w0
wait 100
said QUANT IS 0
expect evpos 30
# COPY BAR 1 (the note at 30), PASTE twice: bar 2 (its note at 400 goes), then bar 3
tapkey w1
wait 100
said COPIED
tapkey w2
wait 100
said BAR PASTED
expect events 2
expect evlast 414
tapkey w2
wait 100
said 1->3
shot p39_bar_paste.png
expect events 3
expect evlast 798
# undo the last paste
press LFO
wait 800
release LFO
wait 100
expect events 2
# SHIFT (SEQ's first row on STEP, K1): the whole clip a step later (30 -> 54), round; one undo step
page 1
row 0
wait 50
turn K1 1
wait 50
expect evpos 54
